# Both frames the stock software sends the radio processor over and
# over (the emulated V575: 8a every 30 s, 81 [06] every 60 s), for 25
# minutes after a fresh start.  With 81 [06] alone a bench 193 started
# again 900 s after the first one, at the sixteenth; with nothing sent,
# after 806 s.  The front after each (info 4 bit 0).
restart
info 0
keepalive off
info 4
toradio 8a
toradio 81 06
info 4
